###
# Usage Notes:
# Returns collection data for multiple cards owned by a user (batch query)
#
# Parameters:
# - userId: The unique identifier of the user
# - cardIds: Array of card IDs to query (GUID format)
#
# Use this for efficient batch loading of card collection data
